<section class="clinicians"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">The science</p><h2 style="font-size:34px">Backed by clinical research</h2><p class="muted">Every active is dosed to the levels used in published studies &mdash; not sprinkled in for the label.</p><div class="clin-grid"><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">300 mg</span><div class="clin-name">SRI-81™ Shatavari</div><p class="clin-quote">A clinically studied adaptogen that supports women through hormonal life stages.*</p></div><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">2,000 mg</span><div class="clin-name">Myo-Inositol</div><p class="clin-quote">A naturally occurring compound that supports hormonal balance and metabolic health.*</p></div><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">200 mg</span><div class="clin-name">Rhodiola Rosea</div><p class="clin-quote">An adaptogen that helps the body adapt to stress and support steady energy.*</p></div><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">75 mg</span><div class="clin-name">Magnesium Malate</div><p class="clin-quote">Supports relaxation, calm and muscle health.*</p></div><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">10 mg</span><div class="clin-name">Vitamin B6</div><p class="clin-quote">Supports energy metabolism and women’s everyday wellbeing.*</p></div><div class="clin-card rx"><span class="rx-dose">25 mg</span><div class="clin-name">Theobromine</div><p class="clin-quote">A gentle plant compound for smooth energy &mdash; no caffeine, no jitters.*</p></div></div><p class="clin-note">*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food &amp; Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Dosages reflect amounts used in published research.</p></div></section><section class="supply-guide"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Know exactly what you're choosing</p><h2>A simple routine. A clear choice.</h2><p class="muted">Compare one-time bundles at one serving per day.</p><div class="supply-cards"><article><span>STARTER</span><h3>20 days</h3><p>1 pouch · 20 stick packs</p><strong>$32.99 total</strong><small>Perfect to start</small></article><article><span>BUILD YOUR ROUTINE</span><h3>40 days</h3><p>2 pouches · 40 stick packs</p><strong>$49.99 total</strong><small>Our most popular</small></article><article><span>LOWEST PRICE PER SERVING</span><h3>80 days</h3><p>4 pouches · 80 stick packs</p><strong>$59.99 total</strong><small>Best value — 4th pouch free</small></article></div><a class="btn" href="#bundle-selector" onclick="goProduct('bundle-selector');return false">Choose your bundle</a><p class="supply-footnote">Supply is based on one daily serving. Bundle prices are one-time charges; shipping is calculated separately where applicable.</p></div></section>
