<p class="eyebrow">Before you ask</p>
<h2 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:20px">Questions, answered.</h2>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What is Vallore SuperBalance, and what does it do? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">A daily drink-mix that supports three connected hormonal systems — ovarian (estrogen rhythm), adrenal (cortisol &amp; stress), and metabolic (insulin &amp; energy) — using six studied ingredients in one strawberry-lemonade glass a day. It supports general wellness and hormone function; it's not a medication.*</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How is it different from other hormone supplements? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Most fix one hormone and hide their doses in &ldquo;proprietary blends.&rdquo; Vallore prints every dose, supports all three systems in one serving, and comes as a drink you'll actually keep up — no blend math, no mystery milligrams, no capsule fatigue.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Does it have caffeine? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">No. The gentle lift comes from 25 mg of theobromine — the feel-good compound in cacao — so you get calm, clean energy with no spike and no crash. It's fine alongside your morning coffee.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">When will I feel a difference? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Energy and calm can show up in the first few days. Adaptogens like Shatavari and Rhodiola build over time — most women notice steadier mood and cycle in weeks 2–4, with the full reset around 6–8 weeks of daily use.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is it safe with birth control, or if I'm pregnant or nursing? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">The ingredients are common daily supplements, not known to interact with most oral contraceptives at these doses. If you're pregnant, nursing, or taking any medication, check with your doctor first — your safety comes first.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I cancel the subscription anytime? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes. Subscribe to save 20%, then skip, pause, or cancel anytime before your next renewal — no phone call, no fee. Prefer no commitment? Choose a one-time order instead.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What's the 60-day guarantee, exactly? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Give Vallore a full 60 days. If you don't feel steadier or more like yourself, email us and we'll refund your most recent order in full — even if the pouch is empty. First order, one per household. We'd rather earn your trust than keep your money.</div></div>
